# ==============================================================================
# GridWatch — Environment Variables Example
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: The application currently runs completely on local mock JSON data
# located in /lib/mock/ via /lib/data.ts. None of these variables are required
# for the app to build or run at this stage (including initial Vercel deployment).
#
# When connecting to Supabase in the future, copy this file to .env.local and
# populate the credentials from your Supabase Project Settings -> API.
# ==============================================================================

# Supabase Project URL (e.g. https://your-project-id.supabase.co)
# Required only when migrating from mock JSON data to live Supabase backend.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co

# Supabase Anon Public API Key (JWT token for public client access)
# Required only when migrating from mock JSON data to live Supabase backend.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
